WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.013
[ominous music playing]

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.074
Advertise your product or brand here
contact www.OpenSubtitles.org today

3
00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:29.362
[man] Your Majesty.
Prince Iksang has arrived.

4
00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.408
Has his son come as well?

5
00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:35.702
Yes. Your Majesty.

6
00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:40.457
How is Prince Yeongan's health?

7
00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.958
[man] There has been no improvement.

8
00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:45.003
so he will not be able to attend
at this time.

9
00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.763
-You may leave.
-[man 2] Yes.

10
00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.057
[door opens]

11
00:00:57.932 --> 00:00:58.892
[door closes]

12
00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:02.604
It seems that Gu-cheon
has failed his part. Your Majesty.

13
00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:07.150
I've heard people say

14
00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:11.446
the reason I am able to sit on this throne
is due to spirits.

15
00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.990
Now they mock me.

16
00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:19.287
saying that my position
will be threatened because of spirits.

17
00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:23.208
Which do you believe to be true?

18
00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:42.227
We will know which one when we get there.

19
00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:44.312
[music fades]

20
00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:49.943
[Jang] Kneel before the honored guest.
straighten yourself.

21
00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:53.404
and perform the four ceremonial bows.

22
00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:55.490
[pressing music playing]

23
00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.537
[Jang] Bow.

24
00:02:01.079 --> 00:02:03.373
Straighten.

25
00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.542
Bow.

26
00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:08.795
Straighten.

27
00:02:09.337 --> 00:02:11.548
Bow.

28
00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:14.050
Straighten.

29
00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:27.063
Next. the Crown Prince
would present a ceremonial drink.

30
00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.357
praying for your long life
without illness.

31
00:02:29.858 --> 00:02:33.444
However. as the seat is vacant.
I suggest you omit it.

32
00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:34.988
No. That's enough.

33
00:02:37.031 --> 00:02:38.950
This tired and old body

34
00:02:39.617 --> 00:02:43.037
cannot be certain any longer
of another birthday to come.

35
00:02:44.038 --> 00:02:47.041
And what do you think of that.
Your Majesty?

36
00:02:51.129 --> 00:02:53.506
Then you must do as you wish. Mother.

37
00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:07.687
Prince Iksang's eldest son.
will you step forward right now?

38
00:03:08.271 --> 00:03:10.356
[man 1] Prince Iksang. congratulations.

39
00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:20.992
[pressing music continues]

40
00:03:40.136 --> 00:03:42.805
[Jang] This is the drink
presented by Prince Inha.

41
00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:46.935
Your Royal Highness.
I pray for your well-being.

42
00:03:49.604 --> 00:03:52.106
[traditional Korean music playing]

43
00:03:59.656 --> 00:04:01.532
[music stops]

44
00:04:03.159 --> 00:04:04.077
[door rattles open]

45
00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.286
[wind whistles]

46
00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:08.581
[man 2] What is happening?

47
00:04:08.665 --> 00:04:10.917
[people murmuring]

48
00:04:13.628 --> 00:04:15.713
[tense music swells]

49
00:04:15.797 --> 00:04:17.799
[tense solemn music playing]

50
00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:32.480
[screaming]

51
00:04:38.987 --> 00:04:40.989
-[wind whistling]
-[sand rustling]

52
00:04:45.702 --> 00:04:47.745
[panicked clamoring]

53
00:04:54.377 --> 00:04:55.503
[Queen gasps]

54
00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:58.715
I can tell
that something has arrived here.

55
00:04:59.215 --> 00:05:01.217
[tense solemn music continues]

56
00:05:13.688 --> 00:05:15.690
[music intensifies]

57
00:05:27.869 --> 00:05:28.786
[King] <i>All right.</i>

58
00:05:30.621 --> 00:05:33.291
<i>I knew that if I drove you far enough.</i>

59
00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:36.711
<i>you would come to me with that resentment.</i>

60
00:05:38.296 --> 00:05:39.505
<i>Now.</i>

61
00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:42.050
<i>what will you do?</i>

62
00:05:56.814 --> 00:05:58.733
[tense dramatic music playing]

63
00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:03.946
[Saeng-gang] Gu-cheon! [gasps]

64
00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.073
[bell jingles]

65
00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:10.203
-[unsettling music playing]
-[body thuds]

66
00:06:10.286 --> 00:06:12.288
[panting]

67
00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:17.377
Get a hold of yourself!

68
00:06:18.836 --> 00:06:20.088
You'll become an ak-gwi.

69
00:06:20.171 --> 00:06:22.340
If you kill.
that's what's going to happen to you.

70
00:06:23.633 --> 00:06:25.426
[Saeng-gang whimpers]

71
00:06:27.512 --> 00:06:29.680
You said that becoming
an ak-gwi after death

72
00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.558
was what you feared more than anything.

73
00:06:38.314 --> 00:06:39.315
Gu-cheon!

74
00:06:40.191 --> 00:06:42.568
Your mother's death was not your fault.
You must believe that.

75
00:06:43.486 --> 00:06:44.821
[grunts]

76
00:06:47.281 --> 00:06:48.157
[gasps]

77
00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:50.618
You were possessed by the gwi-mae.

78
00:06:51.119 --> 00:06:52.245
[groaning]

79
00:06:52.328 --> 00:06:54.497
If you still won't trust me.

80
00:06:55.373 --> 00:06:57.166
then I'll get to the bottom of this.

81
00:06:58.251 --> 00:06:59.627
The second we can leave the palace.

82
00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:01.879
I will go find your mother's grave
so we can uncover the…

83
00:07:01.963 --> 00:07:04.132
[pained gasps]

84
00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:09.137
[pants]

85
00:07:10.972 --> 00:07:12.014
[sobs] Please. Gu-cheon.

86
00:07:12.098 --> 00:07:13.391
[music fades]

87
00:07:13.474 --> 00:07:15.852
Let us make it out of the palace alive.

88
00:07:15.935 --> 00:07:18.438
[Saeng-gang sobs. pants]

89
00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.572
[rhythmic instrumental music playing]

90
00:07:28.239 --> 00:07:30.241
[both breathing heavily]

91
00:08:00.104 --> 00:08:05.026
THE EAST PALACE

92
00:08:05.109 --> 00:08:07.028
[music fades]

93
00:08:07.111 --> 00:08:08.112
[gasps]

94
00:08:08.196 --> 00:08:09.864
[breathing heavily]

95
00:08:19.665 --> 00:08:22.001
[panicked screaming]

96
00:08:22.084 --> 00:08:23.336
[Iksang] What is wrong with him?

97
00:08:23.836 --> 00:08:26.506
What happened to him? Come on. Wake up!

98
00:08:27.006 --> 00:08:28.674
Send for the physician!

99
00:08:28.758 --> 00:08:30.468
Summon the physician now!

100
00:08:30.968 --> 00:08:32.136
[man 1] Your Majesty.

101
00:08:36.474 --> 00:08:38.726
This child is a little flawed.

102
00:08:40.311 --> 00:08:42.313
[solemn ethereal music playing]

103
00:08:43.272 --> 00:08:46.192
You must be disappointed
with what you're observing. Mother.

104
00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.695
In such a frail state.

105
00:08:50.238 --> 00:08:54.242
how could he ever endure
the palace's energy?

106
00:08:58.454 --> 00:09:02.041
I must say you need improving
when reading others. Mother.

107
00:09:03.793 --> 00:09:05.920
Resume the banquet at once.

108
00:09:06.003 --> 00:09:08.548
[man 2] Carry on the music!

109
00:09:08.631 --> 00:09:11.551
[man 1] What are you standing around for?
Attend to Prince Inha at once!

110
00:09:16.389 --> 00:09:18.391
[solemn ethereal music continues]

111
00:09:28.776 --> 00:09:30.861
[gasps. grunts]

112
00:09:30.945 --> 00:09:32.655
[grunting]

113
00:09:33.489 --> 00:09:34.448
[strains]

114
00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:39.245
[stirring string music playing]

115
00:09:41.998 --> 00:09:44.000
[panting]

116
00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.506
No. no.

117
00:10:01.976 --> 00:10:02.977
Princess.

118
00:10:03.894 --> 00:10:04.937
Princess!

119
00:10:14.155 --> 00:10:15.656
[Saeng-gang coughs]

120
00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:16.782
[gasps]

121
00:10:17.491 --> 00:10:19.201
[coughing continues]

122
00:10:22.455 --> 00:10:25.374
[breathing heavily]

123
00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:27.293
[music fades]

124
00:10:27.376 --> 00:10:28.544
Have you lost your mind?

125
00:10:29.378 --> 00:10:31.380
I told you to never set foot in there.

126
00:10:32.381 --> 00:10:34.300
You've never listened to me once.

127
00:10:35.593 --> 00:10:37.261
I saved you. and this is the thanks I get.

128
00:10:38.304 --> 00:10:42.433
Am I supposed to do nothing and just
stand by and watch you become a gwi-sin?

129
00:10:42.516 --> 00:10:44.268
You are never
to do something like that again.

130
00:10:44.352 --> 00:10:46.103
whether I am a spirit or not.

131
00:10:47.396 --> 00:10:50.524
I never want to see someone die
because of me again.

132
00:10:52.777 --> 00:10:54.779
[poignant music playing]

133
00:10:58.574 --> 00:11:00.242
[grunts. pants]

134
00:11:06.749 --> 00:11:08.042
I will never do it again

135
00:11:09.085 --> 00:11:10.711
if you truly cannot bear it.

136
00:11:12.171 --> 00:11:13.339
I. too.

137
00:11:14.965 --> 00:11:17.134
cannot convince myself to go in again.

138
00:11:17.927 --> 00:11:19.512
I was terrified.

139
00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.600
It must have been very difficult for you.

140
00:11:26.519 --> 00:11:28.479
having spent all that time in there.

141
00:11:33.609 --> 00:11:35.194
[Saeng-gang sighs]

142
00:11:37.363 --> 00:11:39.323
[breathing shakily]

143
00:11:43.494 --> 00:11:44.954
[bell jingles]

144
00:11:46.414 --> 00:11:48.624
[jingling continues]

145
00:11:52.086 --> 00:11:54.088
[distant whispering]

146
00:12:03.973 --> 00:12:06.976
[whispering continues]

147
00:12:13.607 --> 00:12:15.609
[woman] Everyone who carries
the King's blood is mad.

148
00:12:15.693 --> 00:12:18.028
There are no such things as spirits.

149
00:12:19.196 --> 00:12:20.239
Mother.

150
00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.575
There are no spirits.

151
00:12:24.452 --> 00:12:25.995
There are no spirits.

152
00:12:26.078 --> 00:12:28.164
[young Saeng-gang breathing nervously]

153
00:12:28.247 --> 00:12:29.373
Mother?

154
00:12:31.125 --> 00:12:33.252
Your father is the palace entity.

155
00:12:33.335 --> 00:12:34.587
[gasps]

156
00:12:35.254 --> 00:12:37.339
[breathing heavily]

157
00:12:58.569 --> 00:12:59.403
How are you?

158
00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.952
What are you doing out there?

159
00:13:07.036 --> 00:13:09.246
How is it? Your fever?

160
00:13:11.081 --> 00:13:13.209
Why would you
open the window without asking?

161
00:13:16.128 --> 00:13:17.922
At least you still have your temper.

162
00:13:23.761 --> 00:13:25.054
[door opens]

163
00:13:25.137 --> 00:13:26.639
[Ji-yul] Miss Saeng-gang. you're awake!

164
00:13:27.681 --> 00:13:29.183
How are you feeling now?

165
00:13:29.683 --> 00:13:31.852
What in the world is going on?

166
00:13:34.688 --> 00:13:35.898
I thought Gu-cheon was dead.

167
00:13:35.981 --> 00:13:37.942
Now he's talking to you
and walking around.

168
00:13:38.025 --> 00:13:40.861
And you. who are perfectly fine.
slept for three days and nights.

169
00:13:40.945 --> 00:13:42.863
I mean. you basically slept like the dead.

170
00:13:43.447 --> 00:13:44.657
It was three days?

171
00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:46.492
Yes! Have this first.

172
00:13:46.575 --> 00:13:49.453
I had to beg the female royal physician
to brew this medicine.

173
00:13:49.537 --> 00:13:51.872
and I snuck some rice cakes
to bring to you here.

174
00:13:51.956 --> 00:13:54.250
You haven't eaten one thing
for three days.

175
00:13:55.084 --> 00:13:56.752
Here. please have these.

176
00:13:58.295 --> 00:13:59.547
I appreciate it.

177
00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:00.965
[tender music playing]

178
00:14:08.055 --> 00:14:10.933
But. um. why did you bring me
so many rice cakes?

179
00:14:12.059 --> 00:14:13.602
It's Gu-cheon.

180
00:14:13.686 --> 00:14:16.063
I brought some for him also.

181
00:14:16.146 --> 00:14:17.273
But he just left.

182
00:14:17.356 --> 00:14:20.192
He must have terrible luck with food.
Is he not even hungry?

183
00:14:20.276 --> 00:14:21.735
He has not eaten for three days.

184
00:14:21.819 --> 00:14:23.821
[tender music continues]

185
00:14:26.532 --> 00:14:27.408
Mmm.

186
00:14:33.873 --> 00:14:35.082
[sighs]

187
00:14:36.584 --> 00:14:39.587
After three days without food.
it tastes better.

188
00:14:40.838 --> 00:14:41.755
Do you want some?

189
00:14:45.259 --> 00:14:47.011
I don't have an appetite.

190
00:14:47.094 --> 00:14:48.554
Please help yourself.

191
00:14:52.016 --> 00:14:53.225
You should eat too.

192
00:14:55.144 --> 00:14:56.604
You cannot work without it.

193
00:14:57.563 --> 00:14:59.523
I found something at the guard's house.

194
00:15:00.441 --> 00:15:02.443
I will handle all of that.

195
00:15:02.526 --> 00:15:04.987
You needn't be concerned. Your Highness.

196
00:15:05.821 --> 00:15:07.031
"Your Highness"?

197
00:15:08.616 --> 00:15:09.450
What?

198
00:15:10.242 --> 00:15:11.076
What?

199
00:15:14.705 --> 00:15:15.956
You have changed somehow.

200
00:15:18.834 --> 00:15:19.835
[Gu-cheon groans]

201
00:15:24.256 --> 00:15:25.299
[Saeng-gang sighs]

202
00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:29.219
So. anyway.

203
00:15:30.012 --> 00:15:32.097
tell me what you have found at the house.

204
00:15:33.807 --> 00:15:37.311
I found what the Favored Court Lady
made for the child she was carrying.

205
00:15:41.357 --> 00:15:43.776
Do you think
this could ease her resentment?

206
00:15:45.361 --> 00:15:49.698
It might be possible.
but the preparation will be complicated.

207
00:15:50.407 --> 00:15:52.284
Her spirit is not ordinary.

208
00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.788
She killed people
for 30 years as a won-gwi.

209
00:15:57.957 --> 00:16:01.210
Oh! The lightning-struck jujube wood.
Where did you get that?

210
00:16:02.169 --> 00:16:05.839
Ah! The jujube tree
inside the palace was struck by lightning.

211
00:16:06.507 --> 00:16:08.634
-Oh.
-Was that branch helpful at all?

212
00:16:10.386 --> 00:16:13.722
It helped a great deal having that wood.
and it will continue to help.

213
00:16:14.223 --> 00:16:15.516
Well.

214
00:16:16.266 --> 00:16:18.686
I believe I have helped
in more ways than one.

215
00:16:19.186 --> 00:16:21.313
The least you could do is say thank you.

216
00:16:21.397 --> 00:16:25.526
You know. the second you brag.
it makes all of your goodwill disappear?

217
00:16:25.609 --> 00:16:27.569
And how is that bragging?

218
00:16:27.653 --> 00:16:29.947
It is simply the praise I am owed.

219
00:16:30.489 --> 00:16:32.491
I nearly died
dealing with your family's mess.

220
00:16:32.574 --> 00:16:34.034
and you want my thanks and praise?

221
00:16:34.827 --> 00:16:36.412
What? You want recognition that badly?

222
00:16:37.329 --> 00:16:38.414
[scoffs]

223
00:16:38.497 --> 00:16:39.498
[Saeng-gang scoffs]

224
00:16:39.581 --> 00:16:41.000
[both sigh]

225
00:16:41.834 --> 00:16:42.876
Forget it.

226
00:16:44.211 --> 00:16:46.755
Fine. I do not need your thanks.

227
00:16:46.839 --> 00:16:48.882
But you should be thanking
the Ggeomeoksali.

228
00:16:50.342 --> 00:16:52.803
The gwi-mae had you in the well.
and it saved you.

229
00:16:53.971 --> 00:16:54.888
That saved me?

230
00:16:54.972 --> 00:16:57.599
I did wonder why
I had not seen it roaming around here.

231
00:16:57.683 --> 00:16:59.768
It fell into the well
while helping fight the gwi-mae.

232
00:17:00.602 --> 00:17:01.854
How sad.

233
00:17:01.937 --> 00:17:03.147
Good riddance.

234
00:17:06.442 --> 00:17:07.860
Don't be cold about it!

235
00:17:07.943 --> 00:17:11.739
I don't make stupid decisions
like getting attached to it like you do.

236
00:17:12.239 --> 00:17:14.867
Let's just focus on the pond spirit
and how to get rid of it.

237
00:17:17.202 --> 00:17:18.162
[sighs]

238
00:17:22.541 --> 00:17:24.793
[groaning]

239
00:17:27.087 --> 00:17:28.464
Is something wrong?

240
00:17:28.547 --> 00:17:29.506
The truth is…

241
00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:31.592
[ominous music playing]

242
00:17:34.803 --> 00:17:38.891
<i>…when I crossed over to the other side.</i>
<i>I came face-to-face with the pond spirit.</i>

243
00:17:39.641 --> 00:17:41.393
-[spectral scream]
-[grunts]

244
00:17:41.477 --> 00:17:44.229
[Saeng-gang] <i>It clawed my back</i>
<i>and drained my spiritual energy.</i>

245
00:17:44.313 --> 00:17:45.689
[squelching]

246
00:17:45.773 --> 00:17:48.776
<i>But I was able to come back</i>
<i>because you pulled the rope just in time.</i>

247
00:17:48.859 --> 00:17:50.736
-[rope whooshes]
-[spectral scream]

248
00:17:52.112 --> 00:17:53.363
[Gu-cheon] <i>It clawed you?</i>

249
00:17:53.447 --> 00:17:55.449
[ethereal music playing]

250
00:18:03.874 --> 00:18:05.042
What's the matter?

251
00:18:08.504 --> 00:18:09.421
Uh…

252
00:18:12.382 --> 00:18:14.843
The spirit
that consumed your soul down there…

253
00:18:17.513 --> 00:18:19.598
has likely begun
to regain its strength from it.

254
00:18:20.808 --> 00:18:24.770
<i>The curse that had briefly weakened</i>
<i>will grow stronger again.</i>

255
00:18:25.646 --> 00:18:26.814
[man] Your Majesty.

256
00:18:27.439 --> 00:18:29.483
The royal physician
attending Prince Yeongan

257
00:18:29.566 --> 00:18:32.778
says you must prepare
yourself for what is to come.

258
00:18:35.114 --> 00:18:37.116
[music intensifies]

259
00:18:45.791 --> 00:18:46.959
[King] Why?

260
00:18:51.421 --> 00:18:53.423
[ethereal music continues]

261
00:18:56.093 --> 00:18:57.261
[sighs]

262
00:18:57.344 --> 00:19:01.723
Is confronting the spirit
impulsively like this truly wise?

263
00:19:02.975 --> 00:19:06.812
I believe Prince Yeongan won't make it
through the night. most likely.

264
00:19:07.312 --> 00:19:10.357
He's reached his limit
after enduring the curse for so long.

265
00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:11.608
[music fades]

266
00:19:11.692 --> 00:19:13.360
We cannot waste more time.

267
00:19:14.862 --> 00:19:16.113
[Gu-cheon grunts]

268
00:19:16.196 --> 00:19:17.281
[low growl]

269
00:19:17.364 --> 00:19:18.574
[gasps] Sh!

270
00:19:20.534 --> 00:19:21.618
Can you hear it?

271
00:19:22.244 --> 00:19:23.245
That sound?

272
00:19:23.328 --> 00:19:25.330
[low growl]

273
00:19:26.623 --> 00:19:29.126
-[unsettling music playing]
-[water trickling]

274
00:19:30.335 --> 00:19:31.420
[low growl]

275
00:19:33.964 --> 00:19:36.133
[growling continues]

276
00:19:38.927 --> 00:19:40.220
Be careful. please.

277
00:19:42.222 --> 00:19:45.142
I am not saving someone
who will not say thank you.

278
00:19:45.225 --> 00:19:46.643
You're still on that?

279
00:19:51.481 --> 00:19:52.733
[water splashes]

280
00:19:52.816 --> 00:19:54.818
[unsettling music continues]

281
00:19:57.571 --> 00:20:00.199
[baby crying]

282
00:20:02.451 --> 00:20:05.454
[crying continues]

283
00:20:15.714 --> 00:20:16.965
[baby crying]

284
00:20:17.049 --> 00:20:19.051
[spirit breathing shakily]

285
00:20:21.845 --> 00:20:23.931
[music intensifies]

286
00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:27.351
[crying continues]

287
00:20:27.935 --> 00:20:29.228
[spirit whispers] My baby.

288
00:20:35.317 --> 00:20:37.069
[dark music playing]

289
00:20:37.569 --> 00:20:38.487
[grunts]

290
00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.864
[low growl]

291
00:20:41.531 --> 00:20:42.658
[grunts. gasps]

292
00:20:45.577 --> 00:20:48.372
-[epic music playing]
-[Gu-cheon] <i>You know how to shoot a bow?</i>

293
00:20:48.455 --> 00:20:51.166
[Saeng-gang] <i>Everyone tried to stop me</i>
<i>because I'm a princess.</i>

294
00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:53.502
<i>but I stubbornly insisted</i>
<i>my father teach me.</i>

295
00:20:53.585 --> 00:20:55.837
[Gu-cheon] <i>So you have been peculiar</i>
<i>since you were little.</i>

296
00:20:56.546 --> 00:20:59.466
<i>I will spin thread from the shirt</i>
<i>made by the Favored Court Lady.</i>

297
00:20:59.549 --> 00:21:01.134
<i>and stain it with my blood.</i>

298
00:21:01.927 --> 00:21:04.638
<i>If you wrap this thread</i>
<i>around an arrow and hit the spirit.</i>

299
00:21:04.721 --> 00:21:06.473
<i>it can weaken its resentment.</i>

300
00:21:07.724 --> 00:21:08.976
Here.

301
00:21:11.353 --> 00:21:14.982
When the baby's crying stops.
that is when you shoot.

302
00:21:17.526 --> 00:21:20.779
<i>We must release the resentment born</i>
<i>of being falsely accused.</i>

303
00:21:20.862 --> 00:21:23.198
<i>as well as the grief of losing her child.</i>

304
00:21:27.911 --> 00:21:31.123
[energy thrumming]

305
00:21:32.666 --> 00:21:33.667
[screams]

306
00:21:40.132 --> 00:21:41.800
[grunts]

307
00:21:43.385 --> 00:21:44.469
[Gu-cheon grunts]

308
00:21:45.178 --> 00:21:46.596
[high-pitched scream]

309
00:21:48.974 --> 00:21:51.101
[Gu-cheon grunts]

310
00:21:56.606 --> 00:21:58.358
[Gu-cheon grunts]

311
00:21:58.442 --> 00:22:00.110
[both groaning]

312
00:22:00.694 --> 00:22:02.362
[Gu-cheon] Killing those of royal blood

313
00:22:02.863 --> 00:22:04.489
will not bring you your child back to you.

314
00:22:05.073 --> 00:22:08.869
So release your resentment now.
and go to the afterlife.

315
00:22:08.952 --> 00:22:12.414
Free yourself
from this hell of a palace. now!

316
00:22:12.497 --> 00:22:14.249
[spirit screams]

317
00:22:16.168 --> 00:22:18.170
[tense percussive music playing]

318
00:22:26.345 --> 00:22:27.888
[music fades]

319
00:22:27.971 --> 00:22:29.973
[mysterious ethereal music playing]

320
00:22:32.225 --> 00:22:33.477
[breathes deeply]

321
00:22:34.936 --> 00:22:35.979
[water splashes]

322
00:22:36.563 --> 00:22:37.439
[gasps]

323
00:22:39.066 --> 00:22:41.693
[Gu-cheon breathing heavily]

324
00:22:42.778 --> 00:22:44.029
[exhales sharply]

325
00:22:44.112 --> 00:22:46.114
[panting]

326
00:22:48.742 --> 00:22:51.661
[Jang] Your Royal Highness.
Prince Yeongan has awakened.

327
00:22:51.745 --> 00:22:53.121
[Queen] What?

328
00:22:55.165 --> 00:22:57.542
Are you saying
he's shown signs of improvement?

329
00:22:57.626 --> 00:23:01.505
Not merely signs of improvement.
He is said to have recovered completely.

330
00:23:01.588 --> 00:23:04.591
<i>It seems that the feng shui master</i>
<i>His Majesty had brought in</i>

331
00:23:04.674 --> 00:23:06.718
<i>has eliminated the pond spirit.</i>

332
00:23:10.055 --> 00:23:11.223
[woman] Your Majesty.

333
00:23:16.978 --> 00:23:19.856
Father. I am better. Father.

334
00:23:25.404 --> 00:23:26.446
You are.

335
00:23:29.533 --> 00:23:30.409
[exhales sharply]

336
00:23:35.122 --> 00:23:39.418
[Queen] <i>So he finally put an end</i>
<i>to the curse that lasted 30 years?</i>

337
00:23:43.713 --> 00:23:44.756
But…

338
00:23:47.634 --> 00:23:49.553
that feng shui master…

339
00:23:50.637 --> 00:23:53.432
How did he prove
that the pond spirit is gone?

340
00:23:54.933 --> 00:23:57.227
I am not sure. Your Royal Highness.

341
00:23:57.310 --> 00:23:59.438
In the process of eliminating the spirit.

342
00:23:59.521 --> 00:24:03.275
he must have learned
what the spirit's true identity was.

343
00:24:04.609 --> 00:24:06.528
and now that man knows the secret.

344
00:24:06.611 --> 00:24:10.031
He knows the truth behind how
that lowly wench turned into a won-gwi.

345
00:24:11.032 --> 00:24:14.369
That man must be silenced at once.

346
00:24:21.835 --> 00:24:24.337
[Saeng-gang] <i>The pond spirit</i>
<i>has finally been eliminated. Father.</i>

347
00:24:24.421 --> 00:24:25.797
[music fades]

348
00:24:26.590 --> 00:24:27.632
Yes.

349
00:24:29.676 --> 00:24:31.303
It does seem that way.

350
00:24:31.386 --> 00:24:33.597
I have now completed your orders.

351
00:24:34.097 --> 00:24:36.016
So I am entitled to a reward.

352
00:24:40.604 --> 00:24:42.939
[rattling]

353
00:24:44.357 --> 00:24:45.567
Before that…

354
00:24:56.953 --> 00:24:58.079
[bell jingles]

355
00:25:00.582 --> 00:25:02.584
[serene ethereal music playing]

356
00:25:03.710 --> 00:25:04.836
[young Saeng-gang] <i>Father.</i>

357
00:25:05.712 --> 00:25:07.380
The palace frightens me.

358
00:25:07.464 --> 00:25:08.673
[King] Frightens you?

359
00:25:08.757 --> 00:25:11.593
And who would ever dare
to frighten a princess?

360
00:25:12.719 --> 00:25:15.555
I keep hearing
strange sounds everywhere I go.

361
00:25:17.891 --> 00:25:19.893
Saeng-gang. come over here.

362
00:25:22.229 --> 00:25:24.439
Here. Carry this with you.

363
00:25:24.523 --> 00:25:27.609
And if you do. this bell will drive away

364
00:25:28.235 --> 00:25:30.737
all of those strange sounds
you are currently hearing.

365
00:25:39.079 --> 00:25:41.081
He lives because of you.

366
00:25:42.290 --> 00:25:43.333
Thank you.

367
00:25:47.337 --> 00:25:48.588
[music fades]

368
00:25:48.672 --> 00:25:51.508
I did not do this
to be praised like a child by you.

369
00:25:54.678 --> 00:25:55.679
Very well.

370
00:25:57.264 --> 00:25:59.224
Then the reward you desire.

371
00:25:59.808 --> 00:26:01.017
What would you like?

372
00:26:01.101 --> 00:26:03.436
Allow Gu-cheon the honor
of leaving the palace immediately.

373
00:26:04.980 --> 00:26:06.565
Of course I will allow it. Yes.

374
00:26:06.648 --> 00:26:08.024
And do not harm him at all.

375
00:26:08.858 --> 00:26:11.736
That is my humble request to you.
Your Majesty.

376
00:26:21.496 --> 00:26:23.582
Why are you not packing your things?

377
00:26:24.124 --> 00:26:27.210
I. uh. have nothing worth packing.

378
00:26:27.294 --> 00:26:28.920
I only need the jujube wood.

379
00:26:33.300 --> 00:26:36.553
For someone leaving the palace.
you do not look very cheerful.

380
00:26:37.596 --> 00:26:38.680
It's just…

381
00:26:41.349 --> 00:26:43.143
Something feels wrong.

382
00:26:44.728 --> 00:26:45.895
[Saeng-gang] What do you mean?

383
00:26:46.605 --> 00:26:48.732
Has Prince Yeongan truly recovered?

384
00:26:48.815 --> 00:26:50.150
Is he completely well?

385
00:26:50.692 --> 00:26:52.235
That is what I was told.

386
00:26:53.278 --> 00:26:55.739
How about your wound? How is that?

387
00:26:56.990 --> 00:26:58.658
The pain is gone at least.

388
00:27:00.201 --> 00:27:01.328
What is the matter?

389
00:27:03.038 --> 00:27:05.707
It should not have been destroyed
so easily.

390
00:27:06.416 --> 00:27:08.335
It was a won-gwi
that had killed the princes

391
00:27:08.418 --> 00:27:10.170
of the East Palace for 30 years.

392
00:27:10.253 --> 00:27:13.632
Four of the late King's sons.
and three of the present king's sons.

393
00:27:14.507 --> 00:27:16.509
For a won-gwi that killed seven.

394
00:27:17.636 --> 00:27:19.596
its power was far too weak.

395
00:27:21.431 --> 00:27:22.974
Are you really sure

396
00:27:24.768 --> 00:27:27.312
that the princes
were killed by the pond spirit alone?

397
00:27:27.937 --> 00:27:31.775
If it wasn't the actions of the spirit.
what's responsible?

398
00:27:33.109 --> 00:27:35.445
[Gu-cheon breathes deeply]

399
00:27:35.945 --> 00:27:36.863
I don't know.

400
00:27:37.822 --> 00:27:40.325
I mean. I thought
it would be a life-or-death struggle.

401
00:27:42.077 --> 00:27:45.205
But seeing how easily
it was resolved is making me doubtful.

402
00:27:46.456 --> 00:27:47.666
I must be out of my mind.

403
00:27:47.749 --> 00:27:49.584
Completely out of my mind.

404
00:27:50.877 --> 00:27:54.089
Since you are departing.
will you go to the temple?

405
00:27:54.172 --> 00:27:55.799
As if I would.

406
00:27:56.508 --> 00:27:58.718
I'm honestly
still thinking about where to go.

407
00:28:00.637 --> 00:28:02.305
And what will you do. Your Highness?

408
00:28:02.389 --> 00:28:04.724
Have you found the one responsible
for your mother's death?

409
00:28:08.520 --> 00:28:10.397
There is just one person it could be.

410
00:28:10.480 --> 00:28:12.482
[ominous music stinger]

411
00:28:33.002 --> 00:28:37.048
[Queen] Are you not the daughter
of the banished Third Senior Consort Han?

412
00:28:37.132 --> 00:28:39.467
What brings you all the way here?

413
00:28:40.093 --> 00:28:42.595
I have brought a gift
to celebrate Your Majesty.

414
00:28:42.679 --> 00:28:44.305
for your 70th birthday.

415
00:28:45.682 --> 00:28:48.351
It's quite modest
compared to the other offerings.

416
00:28:49.185 --> 00:28:51.438
You came all this way for nothing. then.

417
00:28:52.939 --> 00:28:56.651
I never once permitted you
to enter the palace.

418
00:28:56.735 --> 00:28:58.778
It was Father that granted permission.

419
00:28:58.862 --> 00:29:02.407
If that's true.
he did so without my consultation?

420
00:29:02.490 --> 00:29:05.243
Your mother was sent away
for committing a crime.

421
00:29:05.326 --> 00:29:06.995
[Saeng-gang] You mean you framed my mother

422
00:29:07.078 --> 00:29:09.164
and drove her out
to cover up the court maid incident

423
00:29:09.247 --> 00:29:10.331
in the salt storehouse.

424
00:29:10.415 --> 00:29:13.042
Because you feared
that if that incident were to be revealed.

425
00:29:13.126 --> 00:29:15.670
the death of the Favored Court Lady
would come to light.

426
00:29:15.754 --> 00:29:17.714
It's the matter tied to the pond spirit.

427
00:29:17.797 --> 00:29:19.924
One Your Majesty
may wish to keep concealed.

428
00:29:20.008 --> 00:29:22.719
[Queen laughing]

429
00:29:26.347 --> 00:29:30.810
So you barge in spouting nothing
but absurd nonsense in front of me.

430
00:29:30.894 --> 00:29:32.896
Your mother was banished.

431
00:29:33.396 --> 00:29:35.774
She was banished
for burying a cursed object

432
00:29:35.857 --> 00:29:37.275
and because she refused to confess--

433
00:29:37.358 --> 00:29:39.778
Is that why
you had my mother killed back then?

434
00:29:39.861 --> 00:29:41.863
[stirring music playing]

435
00:29:42.447 --> 00:29:45.825
Was her begging my father for help
over and over before she died

436
00:29:46.367 --> 00:29:49.120
what brought up the fear
of exposing your buried sins?

437
00:29:50.288 --> 00:29:52.665
And that poor woman's curse
of the serpent's shed skin.

438
00:29:52.749 --> 00:29:55.335
Is it because you were raised so lowly
outside the palace.

439
00:29:55.418 --> 00:29:57.712
or your mother's origins perchance?

440
00:29:58.546 --> 00:30:00.632
You have truly lost your mind. child.

441
00:30:00.715 --> 00:30:04.010
sitting there.
daring to slander me with such delusions!

442
00:30:06.638 --> 00:30:08.306
You may open the gift.

443
00:30:18.274 --> 00:30:22.779
I have recreated the <i>hangwa </i>she received
from the palace the day before she died.

444
00:30:24.197 --> 00:30:26.199
[breathing heavily]

445
00:30:30.829 --> 00:30:33.790
[Saeng-gang] <i>Not only the taste.</i>
<i>but also the ingredients are the same.</i>

446
00:30:34.624 --> 00:30:35.834
You may try it.

447
00:30:37.001 --> 00:30:39.003
[music intensifies]

448
00:30:58.815 --> 00:31:02.735
Who on earth told you lies
about such a story?

449
00:31:02.819 --> 00:31:04.696
I had no hand in your mother's death.

450
00:31:04.779 --> 00:31:06.823
nor in the death
of the Favored Court Lady.

451
00:31:07.323 --> 00:31:10.618
How could you possibly know events
from long ago?

452
00:31:13.246 --> 00:31:16.875
Was it that feng shui master Gu-cheon
who told you all of this?

453
00:31:17.584 --> 00:31:21.546
I should have taught that bastard
the palace's lesson sooner.

454
00:31:21.629 --> 00:31:25.800
That those who dare to spread lies.
here within these very walls.

455
00:31:27.260 --> 00:31:28.928
will soon be dead.

456
00:31:29.012 --> 00:31:31.014
[grunting]

457
00:31:32.765 --> 00:31:34.767
[Gu-cheon groans. pants]

458
00:31:36.311 --> 00:31:39.606
Tell me about the pond ghost
and what you've learned about it.

459
00:31:39.689 --> 00:31:40.899
A ghost?

460
00:31:41.399 --> 00:31:42.567
In a pond?

461
00:31:42.650 --> 00:31:45.695
Are you talking about your grandfather
who drowned in the bath?

462
00:31:46.446 --> 00:31:48.448
[grunting]

463
00:31:49.991 --> 00:31:51.618
[guard] Throw him into the wooden chest.

464
00:31:56.122 --> 00:31:57.165
[Gu-cheon groans]

465
00:31:59.125 --> 00:32:02.086
[Queen] <i>Death is the only fate for liars</i>
<i>in this strict palace.</i>

466
00:32:02.170 --> 00:32:04.047
<i>Just like your mother in the end.</i>

467
00:32:04.130 --> 00:32:05.757
She was put to a stop.

468
00:32:05.840 --> 00:32:07.842
[music subsides]

469
00:32:08.468 --> 00:32:09.636
I remit

470
00:32:10.803 --> 00:32:12.639
those very words to you.

471
00:32:15.516 --> 00:32:17.518
[intriguing music playing]

472
00:32:18.895 --> 00:32:22.315
[Saeng-gang] This is the baby shirt made
by the Most Favored Lady of the Court.

473
00:32:22.815 --> 00:32:25.902
You gave it to the royal guard
and forced him to falsely claim

474
00:32:25.985 --> 00:32:27.528
the child as his own.

475
00:32:28.237 --> 00:32:30.114
-What is this?
-[Saeng-gang] Your Royal Highness.

476
00:32:30.198 --> 00:32:33.660
I know the Favored Court Lady
was smeared by your lies

477
00:32:34.577 --> 00:32:37.747
and how you managed to have
the royal bloodline all but eliminated.

478
00:32:37.830 --> 00:32:40.583
[cackles] The late King's bloodline.
you say?

479
00:32:41.167 --> 00:32:43.127
That lowly maid who decided
she wanted to dance

480
00:32:43.211 --> 00:32:44.253
with a mere royal guard?

481
00:32:44.337 --> 00:32:45.463
[Saeng-gang] Why go that far?

482
00:32:45.546 --> 00:32:48.299
Unlike the other concubines
who received the King's favor.

483
00:32:49.175 --> 00:32:50.468
why did you frame and kill her?

484
00:32:50.551 --> 00:32:51.803
Could it be that you were…

485
00:32:55.223 --> 00:32:56.849
jealous of a mere maid. Your Highness?

486
00:32:56.933 --> 00:32:58.810
[hissing]

487
00:33:00.853 --> 00:33:02.188
[music fades]

488
00:33:03.022 --> 00:33:04.357
Jealous?

489
00:33:11.239 --> 00:33:13.074
Did you say I was jealous?

490
00:33:13.658 --> 00:33:17.245
That I harbored jealousy
toward such a lowborn girl?

491
00:33:20.039 --> 00:33:22.125
She once lived as my family's servant.

492
00:33:22.208 --> 00:33:24.544
I was the one
who allowed her to serve in the palace

493
00:33:24.627 --> 00:33:28.131
as a menial labor maid.
and you think I was jealous?

494
00:33:28.214 --> 00:33:30.008
[screams] Is that what you're saying?

495
00:33:30.091 --> 00:33:32.093
[clattering]

496
00:33:32.176 --> 00:33:33.886
[tense music playing]

497
00:33:35.346 --> 00:33:40.768
Unlike you. I hail from
a noble lineage spanning generations!

498
00:33:41.352 --> 00:33:43.354
For years on end.

499
00:33:44.272 --> 00:33:46.899
I endured
the late King's scorn and neglect

500
00:33:46.983 --> 00:33:49.777
for failing to bear a child for him.

501
00:33:49.861 --> 00:33:53.114
The fact that a lowly maidservant
received His Majesty's love

502
00:33:53.197 --> 00:33:57.076
and could carry his child.
I could not accept it!

503
00:33:57.577 --> 00:33:58.411
[hissing]

504
00:33:58.494 --> 00:34:00.371
I could allow daughters
of the noble households

505
00:34:00.455 --> 00:34:03.291
and their children.
but I could never allow

506
00:34:03.374 --> 00:34:07.128
for that lowly. feeble woman
to carry his child.

507
00:34:07.211 --> 00:34:12.133
[labored] She had to be eliminated
by any means necessary at all.

508
00:34:14.177 --> 00:34:16.554
Is that why you
made all those false claims then?

509
00:34:16.637 --> 00:34:18.389
Yeah!

510
00:34:18.890 --> 00:34:24.937
I had that slut tortured.
then I myself killed the filthy blood

511
00:34:25.021 --> 00:34:27.356
that continued to grow inside her!

512
00:34:27.440 --> 00:34:28.483
[hissing]

513
00:34:29.942 --> 00:34:32.403
[gasps. groans]

514
00:34:32.487 --> 00:34:33.780
Your Majesty.

515
00:34:33.863 --> 00:34:36.491
-[music subsides]
-[Queen groaning]

516
00:34:39.619 --> 00:34:41.162
I heard you clearly.

517
00:34:41.746 --> 00:34:45.208
Your confession
that you killed the Favored Court Lady

518
00:34:46.084 --> 00:34:47.585
and eliminated the King's son.

519
00:34:48.336 --> 00:34:49.420
[breathes heavily]

520
00:34:49.504 --> 00:34:51.631
What? What?

521
00:34:51.714 --> 00:34:54.884
I will make this public
before Father and all the other ministers.

522
00:34:54.967 --> 00:34:56.928
-[tense solemn music playing]
-[groans]

523
00:34:57.011 --> 00:34:58.721
[Saeng-gang] You stated to me earlier

524
00:34:58.805 --> 00:35:02.058
that liars meet
their timely death in the palace.

525
00:35:03.851 --> 00:35:06.437
Tell me. Your Royal Highness.

526
00:35:07.105 --> 00:35:09.065
what would death mean to you?

527
00:35:09.148 --> 00:35:12.276
It would be losing the palace
and everything that defines you.

528
00:35:12.360 --> 00:35:14.904
[coughing]

529
00:35:14.987 --> 00:35:17.031
[Saeng-gang]
The home you have lived in all your life.

530
00:35:17.115 --> 00:35:19.826
The power you've enjoyed for many years.

531
00:35:20.660 --> 00:35:21.911
I'll make sure it's all gone.

532
00:35:21.994 --> 00:35:23.412
[breathing shakily]

533
00:35:23.496 --> 00:35:24.622
[Jang] Your Majesty.

534
00:35:24.705 --> 00:35:25.790
[Queen growls]

535
00:35:25.873 --> 00:35:29.627
And what could someone like you

536
00:35:29.710 --> 00:35:31.629
possibly do?

537
00:35:32.255 --> 00:35:37.135
Who would ever believe the words
of a lowborn expelled from the palace?

538
00:35:37.218 --> 00:35:38.344
Who?!

539
00:35:40.263 --> 00:35:41.514
That much I know.

540
00:35:43.099 --> 00:35:45.101
Who would listen to the mere words

541
00:35:45.726 --> 00:35:47.019
of the lost princess?

542
00:35:51.315 --> 00:35:52.233
[gasps]

543
00:35:52.316 --> 00:35:53.860
[music intensifies]

544
00:35:56.487 --> 00:36:00.825
Your Majesty. I believe your voice
was loud enough for everyone to hear.

545
00:36:02.368 --> 00:36:03.286
Now.

546
00:36:05.037 --> 00:36:06.414
the time has come

547
00:36:06.914 --> 00:36:10.293
for you to kill these women
the same as you did before.

548
00:36:13.713 --> 00:36:15.798
You will need a lot of jars
for their bones.

549
00:36:17.175 --> 00:36:18.259
[Sukbin] Let us go.

550
00:36:19.051 --> 00:36:20.720
[music soars]

551
00:36:23.681 --> 00:36:24.807
[Queen groans]

552
00:36:30.897 --> 00:36:32.899
[music swells]

553
00:36:33.441 --> 00:36:35.067
-Your Majesty!
-[Queen groans]

554
00:36:35.610 --> 00:36:37.361
-[grunts]
-Your Majesty!

555
00:36:37.987 --> 00:36:39.739
[Gu-cheon groaning]

556
00:36:39.822 --> 00:36:42.742
-[Gu-cheon panting]
-[tuts]

557
00:36:43.701 --> 00:36:45.870
[man 1] I cannot keep
my eyes off you for a second.

558
00:36:45.953 --> 00:36:48.164
Why are you lying in there.
beaten to a pulp?

559
00:36:53.753 --> 00:36:55.129
[Gu-cheon grunts]

560
00:36:59.425 --> 00:37:01.969
What trouble did you cause today

561
00:37:02.511 --> 00:37:04.972
to make Her Majesty want you dead?

562
00:37:06.766 --> 00:37:08.684
Was it not ordered by the King?

563
00:37:09.393 --> 00:37:12.188
To see if I'm capable
of keeping my mouth shut or not?

564
00:37:14.315 --> 00:37:15.816
Since you believe that.

565
00:37:16.400 --> 00:37:19.070
it would be pointless
to mention that is not true.

566
00:37:19.153 --> 00:37:21.155
[unsettling music playing]

567
00:37:22.698 --> 00:37:24.533
[Gu-cheon] Then why do you spare me?

568
00:37:26.911 --> 00:37:31.290
The princess earnestly… pleaded
with His Majesty

569
00:37:31.374 --> 00:37:33.334
to let you leave the palace unscathed.

570
00:37:34.543 --> 00:37:37.129
She must have foreseen
something like this.

571
00:37:45.179 --> 00:37:46.764
This is your pass to leave the palace.

572
00:37:47.890 --> 00:37:49.684
-[pass thuds]
-[coins jingle]

573
00:37:49.767 --> 00:37:51.352
And your compensation.

574
00:37:51.852 --> 00:37:52.687
[coins thud]

575
00:37:53.437 --> 00:37:54.939
Watch your mouth out there.

576
00:37:55.022 --> 00:37:58.192
All eight provinces of Joseon
lie in the hand of His Majesty.

577
00:38:12.665 --> 00:38:13.749
[grunts]

578
00:38:16.377 --> 00:38:18.379
[music fades]

579
00:38:22.967 --> 00:38:25.303
They do not let me go easily.

580
00:38:25.386 --> 00:38:27.388
[women chattering indistinctly]

581
00:38:28.431 --> 00:38:30.349
Still. it's over now.

582
00:38:31.309 --> 00:38:34.103
[purring]

583
00:38:35.229 --> 00:38:36.188
[Gu-cheon] Ah…

584
00:38:40.401 --> 00:38:41.819
[purrs. chomps]

585
00:38:41.902 --> 00:38:42.987
[low grumble]

586
00:38:43.070 --> 00:38:44.905
[chomping. exclaims]

587
00:38:44.989 --> 00:38:46.574
[door hinge squeaks]

588
00:38:46.657 --> 00:38:49.201
-[hissing]
-[ominous music playing]

589
00:38:50.202 --> 00:38:52.246
-[hissing]
-[exclaims]

590
00:38:52.330 --> 00:38:54.332
[hissing continues]

591
00:38:54.915 --> 00:38:57.168
[exclaims]

592
00:38:59.170 --> 00:39:01.130
[grunting]

593
00:39:01.213 --> 00:39:04.300
-[squealing]
-[hissing]

594
00:39:04.383 --> 00:39:06.135
[tense music playing]

595
00:39:06.719 --> 00:39:08.137
I saw nothing.

596
00:39:08.220 --> 00:39:10.222
Nothing at all. I did not see anything.

597
00:39:10.306 --> 00:39:11.682
[Ggeomeoksali squeals]

598
00:39:11.766 --> 00:39:13.309
[exhales sharply]

599
00:39:16.479 --> 00:39:18.439
[Ggeomeoksali squeals]

600
00:39:18.522 --> 00:39:19.398
Ah no!

601
00:39:19.482 --> 00:39:21.609
-[music intensifies]
-[squealing continues]

602
00:39:26.322 --> 00:39:27.990
[Gu-cheon straining]

603
00:39:28.074 --> 00:39:29.867
[hissing]

604
00:39:29.950 --> 00:39:31.243
[Gu-cheon groans]

605
00:39:31.744 --> 00:39:32.661
[hissing]

606
00:39:32.745 --> 00:39:34.872
-Whoa. whoa.
-[Ggeomeoksali squeals. purrs]

607
00:39:37.792 --> 00:39:39.794
[music fades]

608
00:39:40.711 --> 00:39:41.796
[Ggeomeoksali purrs]

609
00:39:41.879 --> 00:39:44.799
[Gu-cheon] I have repaid the debt
I owed you for saving me.

610
00:39:46.133 --> 00:39:47.134
So take care.

611
00:39:50.763 --> 00:39:53.224
[Ggeomeoksali chitters. squeals]

612
00:39:58.562 --> 00:40:00.564
-[squeals]
-[tense music plays]

613
00:40:01.273 --> 00:40:02.358
[squealing sigh]

614
00:40:02.441 --> 00:40:03.943
[music fades]

615
00:40:06.112 --> 00:40:08.489
-[whimsical music playing]
-[sighs]

616
00:40:09.115 --> 00:40:11.325
I'll give you a bit of my yang energy.

617
00:40:11.992 --> 00:40:14.120
Just enough for your body to recover.

618
00:40:14.203 --> 00:40:15.329
[purrs]

619
00:40:15.830 --> 00:40:17.832
[sucking]

620
00:40:21.710 --> 00:40:22.711
Get off!

621
00:40:22.795 --> 00:40:23.879
Let go!

622
00:40:23.963 --> 00:40:26.173
Don't take too much. damn it.
That's enough!

623
00:40:26.757 --> 00:40:27.758
[squeals]

624
00:40:28.467 --> 00:40:29.677
[groans]

625
00:40:29.760 --> 00:40:31.762
[panting]

626
00:40:33.013 --> 00:40:35.349
[groaning]

627
00:40:37.643 --> 00:40:39.061
[music fades]

628
00:40:39.145 --> 00:40:40.229
[horse grunts]

629
00:40:42.231 --> 00:40:43.482
[horse grunts]

630
00:40:53.033 --> 00:40:54.410
[King] You do not look well.

631
00:40:55.744 --> 00:40:56.787
Perhaps you are ill?

632
00:40:58.080 --> 00:41:02.168
It's been hard on me. I think.
working alongside Gu-cheon lately.

633
00:41:03.377 --> 00:41:04.795
And considering the part you played

634
00:41:04.879 --> 00:41:07.298
at the Queen Dowager's quarters
last night.

635
00:41:08.090 --> 00:41:09.675
it makes perfect sense.

636
00:41:09.758 --> 00:41:13.179
And the Queen Dowager.
do you plan to do anything about her?

637
00:41:14.346 --> 00:41:17.349
Is that why you wanted to talk
this early in the morning?

638
00:41:17.433 --> 00:41:18.350
No.

639
00:41:18.434 --> 00:41:21.187
I wanted to make sure
Gu-cheon made it out all right

640
00:41:21.270 --> 00:41:22.897
and is free of the palace.

641
00:41:26.609 --> 00:41:28.527
You fret too easily.

642
00:41:29.820 --> 00:41:34.283
He will have left the palace by now
and surely will have traveled far already.

643
00:41:34.366 --> 00:41:36.911
After all. he saved my son.

644
00:41:38.996 --> 00:41:41.415
I have no desire to hurt Gu-cheon.

645
00:41:42.708 --> 00:41:44.793
He saved my child from death.

646
00:41:46.670 --> 00:41:48.088
Do not be worried.

647
00:41:50.299 --> 00:41:52.259
I must say. though.

648
00:41:52.343 --> 00:41:56.013
I did not expect him
to deal with the pond spirit so easily.

649
00:41:58.265 --> 00:42:01.310
Indeed. Father.
Even Gu-cheon felt strange about it.

650
00:42:01.393 --> 00:42:04.688
He questioned whether it was truly
the pond spirit that killed the princes.

651
00:42:07.024 --> 00:42:08.025
Father…

652
00:42:08.108 --> 00:42:09.818
[unsettling music playing]

653
00:42:09.902 --> 00:42:13.113
…I want to know about the late King's
first son. the Crown Prince.

654
00:42:13.197 --> 00:42:14.657
How exactly did he pass away?

655
00:42:18.410 --> 00:42:20.162
[unsettling music intensifies]

656
00:42:20.246 --> 00:42:21.830
[guard 1] Your Royal Highness!

657
00:42:21.914 --> 00:42:23.165
[guards clamoring]

658
00:42:23.249 --> 00:42:24.542
[guard 2] Your Royal Highness!

659
00:42:24.625 --> 00:42:26.961
-[panting]
-[guard 3] Summon the physician!

660
00:42:27.044 --> 00:42:28.087
The physician!

661
00:42:28.170 --> 00:42:29.672
[breathing shakily]

662
00:42:29.755 --> 00:42:32.091
[guard 2] The Crown Prince…
Your Royal Highness.

663
00:42:32.174 --> 00:42:34.176
[unsettling music continues]

664
00:42:34.802 --> 00:42:35.803
[exhales]

665
00:42:38.472 --> 00:42:39.765
A curse.

666
00:42:43.978 --> 00:42:46.522
He passed away
because a spirit had cursed him.

667
00:42:48.023 --> 00:42:49.942
What of the late King's second son?

668
00:43:08.168 --> 00:43:09.837
[King] <i>A spirit killed him.</i>

669
00:43:10.879 --> 00:43:13.966
The third and fourth brothers as well.
All four of them.

670
00:43:18.721 --> 00:43:20.472
[Gu-cheon] <i>Are you really sure</i>

671
00:43:20.556 --> 00:43:23.475
<i>that the princes</i>
<i>were killed by the pond spirit alone?</i>

672
00:43:29.857 --> 00:43:31.275
What is the matter?

673
00:43:35.237 --> 00:43:38.824
Your Majesty.
The hunting preparations are complete.

674
00:43:38.907 --> 00:43:40.909
Prince Yeongan is waiting for you.

675
00:43:41.493 --> 00:43:42.494
[King] Very well.

676
00:43:44.622 --> 00:43:46.165
[breathing shakily]

677
00:43:47.958 --> 00:43:49.501
We will continue this later.

678
00:43:59.970 --> 00:44:02.139
[music swells]

679
00:44:02.222 --> 00:44:03.932
[spectral voices whispering]

680
00:44:04.016 --> 00:44:06.060
[Saeng-gang panting]

681
00:44:10.481 --> 00:44:12.399
[spectral voices continue]

682
00:44:22.743 --> 00:44:24.745
[music intensifies]

683
00:44:28.499 --> 00:44:30.501
[Saeng-gang pants]

684
00:44:36.298 --> 00:44:37.466
[exhales sharply]

685
00:44:39.843 --> 00:44:42.471
[King] <i>We cannot allow him</i>
<i>to learn the truth of the pond spirit.</i>

686
00:44:42.554 --> 00:44:45.641
-[Saeng-gang] <i>Stop. I don't wanna hear it.</i>
-[man] <i>You do not need to know either.</i>

687
00:44:45.724 --> 00:44:48.435
[Saeng-gang] <i>I do not want</i>
<i>to know any more. </i>[pants]

688
00:44:48.519 --> 00:44:49.520
<i>Please. someone…</i>

689
00:44:49.603 --> 00:44:50.979
[Jang] <i>…admitted to the crime…</i>

690
00:44:51.063 --> 00:44:53.440
-[Saeng-gang] <i>Help me.</i>
-<i>Your father is the palace entity.</i>

691
00:44:53.524 --> 00:44:55.275
[screams]

692
00:44:55.359 --> 00:44:56.985
[music swells]

693
00:44:57.069 --> 00:44:57.903
[gasps]

694
00:44:57.986 --> 00:44:59.279
[music subsides]

695
00:44:59.363 --> 00:45:00.698
Why are you crying?

696
00:45:01.365 --> 00:45:02.991
More importantly.
why haven't you left yet?

697
00:45:03.075 --> 00:45:04.952
There's one thing I didn't see.

698
00:45:05.536 --> 00:45:07.788
The spirit that cursed Prince Yeongan

699
00:45:07.871 --> 00:45:09.665
was not the Favored Court Lady.

700
00:45:11.250 --> 00:45:13.252
The one that tore
your body and soul was not her.

701
00:45:13.335 --> 00:45:14.670
There's got to be another.

702
00:45:15.379 --> 00:45:16.213
Then. um…

703
00:45:16.296 --> 00:45:18.215
[dramatic music playing]

704
00:45:18.298 --> 00:45:20.384
…who was the one that tried to kill

705
00:45:21.176 --> 00:45:22.553
Crown Prince Yeongan?

706
00:45:25.723 --> 00:45:27.725
[breathing heavily]

707
00:45:30.102 --> 00:45:32.104
[music intensifies]

708
00:45:32.187 --> 00:45:34.189
[squelching]

709
00:45:37.192 --> 00:45:39.194
[man] I will have my revenge.

710
00:45:40.112 --> 00:45:41.196
The King

711
00:45:42.656 --> 00:45:45.659
must pay for the sins
that he has committed.

712
00:45:49.288 --> 00:45:52.291
<i>The secrets of</i>
<i>the royal house will be revealed.</i>

713
00:45:52.791 --> 00:45:53.667
<i>And I…</i>

714
00:45:55.210 --> 00:45:57.379
<i>I will become the real one.</i>

715
00:46:00.340 --> 00:46:04.219
I will wipe out the royal bloodline!

716
00:46:05.637 --> 00:46:07.639
[dramatic music continues]

717
00:46:12.436 --> 00:46:13.562
[coughs]

718
00:46:22.070 --> 00:46:23.280
-[squelching]
-[screams]

719
00:46:24.281 --> 00:46:26.784
[screaming]

720
00:46:27.993 --> 00:46:29.286
-[spectral scream]
-[grunts]

721
00:46:32.039 --> 00:46:34.458
-[exhales]
-[squelching]

722
00:46:40.964 --> 00:46:44.426
[spectral screaming]

723
00:46:47.971 --> 00:46:50.349
[Saeng-gang moaning]

724
00:46:51.475 --> 00:46:54.102
[groaning]

725
00:46:55.687 --> 00:46:57.773
[grunting]

726
00:47:00.275 --> 00:47:01.193
[gasps]

727
00:47:02.736 --> 00:47:04.738
[dramatic percussive music playing]

728
00:47:16.291 --> 00:47:19.837
[spectral voices echoing]

729
00:47:21.880 --> 00:47:23.549
[both panting]

730
00:47:24.800 --> 00:47:27.302
Prince Yeongan.
We need to go find Prince Yeongan!

731
00:47:27.803 --> 00:47:28.637
Wait.

732
00:47:29.304 --> 00:47:30.305
It's already too late.

733
00:47:30.389 --> 00:47:31.723
[music subsides]

734
00:47:31.807 --> 00:47:34.476
[epic music playing]

735
00:47:38.272 --> 00:47:40.274
[horse neighs]

736
00:47:45.863 --> 00:47:48.031
[guard 1] Is there a royal physician
back there?

737
00:47:48.699 --> 00:47:50.617
[guard 2] Send for the royal physician!

738
00:47:51.660 --> 00:47:52.536
Take formation.

739
00:47:52.619 --> 00:47:55.956
[guard 1] Stay calm. everyone.
Don't break formation.

740
00:47:56.790 --> 00:47:58.000
[guard 3] Secure the perimeter.

741
00:47:58.083 --> 00:48:00.210
-What's happening?
-[guard 4] Protect His Majesty!

742
00:48:03.714 --> 00:48:05.674
Then you should leave the palace
through this path.

743
00:48:05.757 --> 00:48:06.633
You must run away now.

744
00:48:06.717 --> 00:48:08.927
Since you were unable to save his son.

745
00:48:09.428 --> 00:48:11.555
he will find you and kill you immediately.

746
00:48:12.055 --> 00:48:13.473
But if I leave you behind.

747
00:48:14.474 --> 00:48:16.727
you will die the same as Prince Yeongan.

748
00:48:18.353 --> 00:48:20.063
-[gasps. exhales]
-[music subsides]

749
00:48:20.772 --> 00:48:23.191
-That is a matter beyond your concern.
-It does concern me.

750
00:48:23.775 --> 00:48:25.277
You saved my life.

751
00:48:25.360 --> 00:48:27.821
You risked everything
coming to the other realm to save me.

752
00:48:27.905 --> 00:48:31.325
and now this time.
I'll be the one who is going to save you.

753
00:48:34.661 --> 00:48:36.663
{\an8}[epic music continues]

754
00:51:33.256 --> 00:51:34.716
[music fades]

755
00:51:35.305 --> 00:52:35.916
